%% frame: S3 Distribution: the one synchronous call, failing closed (design)
sequenceDiagram
    participant App as :PurchaseIntentAppService
    participant Remote as :RemoteUserAppService
    participant Ctl as :InternalUserController
    participant Impl as :UserAppServiceImpl
    participant Repo as :UserRepository

    Note over App,Remote: commerce-svc, inside the caller's transaction
    App->>Remote: requireActive(userId)
    Remote->>Ctl: requireActive(id): GET /internal/users/{id}/active
    Note over Ctl,Repo: identity-svc, reached by service name; 500 ms connect, 1500 ms read, no retry
    Ctl->>Impl: requireActive(id)
    critical identity read, REQUIRED, read-only
        Impl->>Repo: findById(id)
        Repo-->>Impl: Optional<User>
    end
    alt account exists and is active
        Impl-->>Ctl: void
        Ctl-->>Remote: 200, Result.ok
        Remote-->>App: void
    else account missing or disabled
        Impl-->>Ctl: BizException USER_NOT_FOUND or ACCOUNT_DISABLED
        Ctl-->>Remote: 404 IDENTITY_404_001 or 403 IDENTITY_403_001
        Remote-->>App: BizException with the same IdentityErrorCode
    else timeout, 5xx, unknown route or any other answer
        Remote-->>App: IdentityUnavailableException
        Note over App,Remote: not a BizException: the caller's transaction rolls back and the request fails with HTTP 500
    end
